{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_title", "source_sha256": "85ad291d14293b0bd44cda38c72e70cbb4df9fed068c6fd414a52411b8bea0d4", "ja": "ジュリアとおでかけ1", "zh": "和茱莉亚外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dcb97d155082c44cc79b13aaab51f9990e20d18e6b1d5e10551741d9eaeb0d70", "ja": "ジュリアとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与茱莉亚一同外出的一个场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "be8eff2af7e6af4abcd171503c568267473e7c1553f4341591e0fa1f7fc48ba0", "ja": "（山梨はぶどうの名産地という事で、ジュリアに\nぶどうのキャンペーンガールの仕事が来た）", "zh": "（因为山梨是葡萄产地，茱莉亚接到了担任葡萄宣传大使的工作）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "98867b433967eab9fbd89d044edcedc23c9480210ddd53a9df65b391608608d3", "ja": "おい、バカP。話があるんだけど。", "zh": "喂，笨蛋P。我有话要说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "64c466a5309e2b85519df094e207a79ddc0bdd24dc0e1d7fb9e66fe799afb03f", "ja": "あっ、ジュリア。\n不機嫌だな……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "啊，茱莉亚。\n看起来心情不好啊……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "5305433bb9024ba4946123997dc87faf34dc2a00a216f0d9723bb3e1a1705c35", "ja": "「どうかしたのか？」じゃないだろ！\nぶどうを売るのに、なんで衣装がメイド服なんだよ！", "zh": "什么叫“怎么了”啊！\n去卖葡萄，为什么服装偏偏是女仆装啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8ef087a654964ea3836f701be7d4fe367ff8134dd35c2e24ee664e16cc4513a2", "ja": "そう言われても、先方の希望も汲んでの事だから……\n可愛いし、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "就算你这么说，也是考虑到对方的希望才这么安排的……而且挺可爱的，这不是很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "5b9cadaa83c3cfb9b0c0281dcec73b66ff0b62806aef0768c54dd285459e211c", "ja": "カワイイから困ってるんだろ！？\nいいか、あたしは絶対着ないからな！", "zh": "就是因为可爱才为难啊！？\n听好了，我绝对不会穿的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "6de07fa0eaf64d04d8335535bca04735d35ff65edcc30a4cbcae3173f3757fd4", "ja": "どうしてもあたしに着せたいなら、\n力ずくででも説得してみせろっていうんだ。フフン♪", "zh": "你要是无论如何都想让我穿，那就算用强硬手段，也得说服我才行。哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9973027d09e415d19fdf1f8acb3c50f952b92998e0f050e5f4a05b92524539f0", "ja": "そうか……よし、わかった！\nジュリア！", "zh": "这样啊……好，我明白了！茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4ababc16d9b61a2e527711bfe29548812219ab095157b69198f765f8f54848d4", "ja": "クールな美人のジュリアが着るメイド服、\n最高にロックだぞ！　よっ、ボーントゥビーロック！", "zh": "冷酷美女的茱莉亚穿上女仆装，\n简直摇滚到极点！哟，天生就是摇滚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "d4a5b1ef22a77130763ef6632263b5263ca6cb8452aee86679c79d95170e92ac", "ja": "クールな……び、美人？\nいや、なんか柄じゃないんだけど……。", "zh": "冷酷的……美、美人？\n不对，总觉得这不适合我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "21eb5ed68d676a9208cd9561644feea836fd9fed09c9588e15a2fced6177131f", "ja": "あーもー、わかったって！　今回だけは着てやる。\nだからって、調子に乗ってこういう仕事増やすなよ！？", "zh": "啊真是的，我知道了啦！就这次穿给你看。\n但你可别得意忘形，又给我增加这种工作啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_050jul01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_050jul01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "42970e9c10bd12b32ef01b497d1b0787ad7386a8fb54913bae2137637422cc71", "ja": "（何だかんだ言って人がいいんだよな……。\nキャンペーンガールの仕事、頑張ってもらおう！）", "zh": "（嘴上这么说，其实人还是挺好的嘛……让她好好加油完成宣传女孩的工作吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
